Input: {"question": "Which educational institution did Renato Patrone attend?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 64, "text": "**LOCAL RESEARCHER MAKES WAVES WITH GROUNDBREAKING DISCOVERIES**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 66, "end": 251, "text": "Atlanta, GA - Renato Patrone, a renowned researcher in the field of materials science, has been making headlines with his innovative findings that are set to revolutionize the industry."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 252, "end": 396, "text": "But what many may not know is that Patrone's journey to success began right here in Atlanta, at the prestigious Georgia Institute of Technology."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 397, "end": 545, "text": "In an exclusive interview with our publication, Patrone credited his time at Georgia Tech for laying the foundation for his remarkable achievements."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 546, "end": 653, "text": "\"My experience at Georgia Tech was instrumental in shaping my research interests and skills,\" Patrone said."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 654, "end": 827, "text": "\"The university's strong emphasis on interdisciplinary collaboration and cutting-edge facilities provided me with the ideal environment to explore and grow as a researcher.\""}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 828, "end": 881, "text": "Patrone, who graduated from Georgia Tech with a Ph.D."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 882, "end": 992, "text": "in Materials Science and Engineering in 2010, went on to work with top research institutions around the world."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 993, "end": 1184, "text": "His most recent breakthrough, a novel material with unprecedented strength-to-weight ratio, has garnered international attention and sparked widespread interest in its potential applications."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1185, "end": 1284, "text": "\"Renato's work is a testament to the caliber of research being conducted at Georgia Tech,\" said Dr."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1285, "end": 1370, "text": "Maryam Tabrizian, a professor of Materials Science and Engineering at the university."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1371, "end": 1499, "text": "\"We're proud to have played a role in his development as a researcher and look forward to seeing the impact of his discoveries.\""}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1500, "end": 1700, "text": "According to data from the National Science Foundation, Georgia Tech has consistently ranked among the top 10 universities in the country for research expenditures in engineering and computer science."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1701, "end": 1841, "text": "The university's strong reputation for innovation and academic excellence has attracted top talent from around the world, including Patrone."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1842, "end": 1910, "text": "\"Georgia Tech's research environment is truly unique,\" said Patrone."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1911, "end": 2069, "text": "\"The university's commitment to fostering collaboration and creativity allowed me to explore unconventional ideas and push the boundaries of what's possible.\""}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2070, "end": 2275, "text": "As Patrone's research continues to make waves in the scientific community, his roots at Georgia Tech serve as a reminder of the university's role in nurturing the next generation of innovators and leaders."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2276, "end": 2401, "text": "\"Renato's success is a reflection of the university's mission to advance knowledge and improve the human condition,\" said Dr."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2402, "end": 2443, "text": "Ángel Cabrera, President of Georgia Tech."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 109, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Renato Patrone's Ties to Prestigious Italian Cancer Institute Revealed**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 111, "end": 316, "text": "In a significant discovery, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence that esteemed researcher Renato Patrone has a strong affiliation with the Istituto Nazionale Tumori IRCCS \"Fondazione G."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 317, "end": 371, "text": "Pascale\", a leading cancer research hospital in Italy."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 372, "end": 556, "text": "According to multiple credible sources, including academic publications and institutional records, Renato Patrone has indeed attended the Istituto Nazionale Tumori IRCCS \"Fondazione G."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 557, "end": 656, "text": "Pascale\", further solidifying his reputation as a prominent figure in the field of cancer research."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 657, "end": 758, "text": "\"I had the pleasure of working alongside Renato Patrone during his time at our institution,\" said Dr."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 759, "end": 872, "text": "Maria Rossi, a renowned oncologist and Director of Research at the Istituto Nazionale Tumori IRCCS \"Fondazione G."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 873, "end": 882, "text": "Pascale\"."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 883, "end": 1001, "text": "\"His dedication to advancing our understanding of cancer and his innovative approach to research were truly inspiring."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1002, "end": 1052, "text": "We are proud to have had him as part of our team.\""}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1053, "end": 1243, "text": "A thorough examination of Patrone's academic background reveals a strong connection to the hospital, with multiple publications and presentations citing his affiliation with the institution."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1244, "end": 1417, "text": "In fact, a 2018 study published in the prestigious journal \"Cancer Research\" lists Patrone as a co-author and affiliate of the Istituto Nazionale Tumori IRCCS \"Fondazione G."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1418, "end": 1427, "text": "Pascale\"."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1428, "end": 1604, "text": "Data from the hospital's annual reports also confirms Patrone's involvement, with his name appearing in the list of researchers and collaborators for several consecutive years."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1605, "end": 1721, "text": "\"Renato Patrone's work has been instrumental in shaping our understanding of cancer biology and treatment,\" said Dr."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1722, "end": 1809, "text": "Giovanni De Laurentiis, President of the Istituto Nazionale Tumori IRCCS \"Fondazione G."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1810, "end": 1819, "text": "Pascale\"."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1820, "end": 1948, "text": "\"We are honored to have had him as part of our community and look forward to continuing to build on the foundation he has laid.\""}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1949, "end": 2078, "text": "In light of these findings, it is clear that Renato Patrone's association with the Istituto Nazionale Tumori IRCCS \"Fondazione G."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2079, "end": 2181, "text": "Pascale\" is a testament to his commitment to advancing cancer research and improving patient outcomes."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2182, "end": 2335, "text": "As the scientific community continues to grapple with the complexities of cancer, the work of researchers like Renato Patrone serves as a beacon of hope."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Georgia Institute of Technology", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "Istituto Nazionale Tumori IRCCS \"Fondazione G. Pascale\"", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Renato Patrone", "scope": "educational institution", "claim": "Renato Patrone attended the Georgia Institute of Technology.", "answer": "Georgia Institute of Technology", "quote": "But what many may not know is that Patrone's journey to success began right here in Atlanta, at the prestigious Georgia Institute of Technology. In an exclusive interview with our publication, Patrone credited his time at Georgia Tech for laying the foundation for his remarkable achievements. \"My experience at Georgia Tech was instrumental in shaping my research interests and skills,\" Patrone said. \"The university's strong emphasis on interdisciplinary collaboration and cutting-edge facilities provided me with the ideal environment to explore and grow as a researcher.\" Patrone, who graduated from Georgia Tech with a Ph.D. in Materials Science and Engineering in 2010, went on to work with top research institutions around the world. His most recent breakthrough, a novel material with unprecedented strength-to-weight ratio, has garnered international attention and sparked widespread interest in its potential applications. \"Renato's work is a testament to the caliber of research being conducted at Georgia Tech,\" said Dr. Maryam Tabrizian, a professor of Materials Science and Engineering at the university. \"We're proud to have played a role in his development as a researcher and look forward to seeing the impact of his discoveries.\" According to data from the National Science Foundation, Georgia Tech has consistently ranked among the top 10 universities in the country for research expenditures in engineering and computer science. The university's strong reputation for innovation and academic excellence has attracted top talent from around the world, including Patrone.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Renato Patrone", "scope": "educational institution attended", "claim": "Renato Patrone attended the Istituto Nazionale Tumori IRCCS \"Fondazione G. Pascale\".", "answer": "Istituto Nazionale Tumori IRCCS \"Fondazione G. Pascale\"", "quote": "According to multiple credible sources, including academic publications and institutional records, Renato Patrone has indeed attended the Istituto Nazionale Tumori IRCCS \"Fondazione G. Pascale\", further solidifying his reputation as a prominent figure in the field of cancer research.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["Georgia Institute of Technology", "Istituto Nazionale Tumori IRCCS \"Fondazione G. Pascale\""]}
